msgid "Zswap Configuration"
msgstr "Настройка Zswap"

msgid "lzo-rle is fastest, zstd saves more space"
msgstr "lzo-rle работает быстрее, zstd экономит больше места"

msgid "<i>Recommended: {0}–{1} MiB, lzo-rle, priority 100 (for {2} GiB RAM)</i>"
msgstr "<i>Recommended: {0}–{1} MiB, lzo-rle, priority 100 (for {2} GiB RAM)</i>"

msgid "Compress swap pages in a RAM pool — faster than disk swap. Use Zram or Zswap, not both."
msgstr "Compress swap pages in a RAM pool — faster than disk swap. Use Zram or Zswap, not both."

msgid "Create a compressed RAM swap device for faster memory pressure handling."
msgstr "Create a compressed RAM swap device for faster memory pressure handling."

msgid "Disk swap is active with memory compression — your system is well-protected against memory pressure."
msgstr "Disk swap is active with memory compression — your system is well-protected against memory pressure."

msgid "Enable Zram for snappy compressed swap in RAM — it's 10× faster than disk swap and dramatically reduces I/O under memory pressure."
msgstr "Enable Zram for snappy compressed swap in RAM — it's 10× faster than disk swap and dramatically reduces I/O under memory pressure."

msgid "Hibernation active — minimum {0} GiB (RAM + 1 GiB). Recommended: {1} GiB"
msgstr "Hibernation active — minimum {0} GiB (RAM + 1 GiB). Recommended: {1} GiB"

msgid "How aggressively the kernel swaps — lower = stay in RAM longer (recommended: {0})"
msgstr "How aggressively the kernel swaps — lower = stay in RAM longer (recommended: {0})"

msgid "Only store pages that compress to ≤ this % of original. Higher = more pages cached. Recommended: 90%"
msgstr "Only store pages that compress to ≤ this % of original. Higher = more pages cached. Recommended: 90%"

msgid "When RAM is full the kernel may kill applications. Enable disk swap for a reliable safety net."
msgstr "When RAM is full the kernel may kill applications. Enable disk swap for a reliable safety net."

msgid "Zram and Zswap are mutually exclusive — each creates its own compressed RAM pool. Running both wastes CPU and can cause severe memory thrashing. Disable one of them."
msgstr "Zram and Zswap are mutually exclusive — each creates its own compressed RAM pool. Running both wastes CPU and can cause severe memory thrashing. Disable one of them."

msgid "lz4 = fast (recommended), zstd = best ratio, lzo = legacy. Changing requires zswap restart."
msgstr "lz4 = быстро (рекомендуется), zstd = лучшее сжатие, lzo = устаревший. Изменение требует перезапуска zswap."

msgid "with Zram active — prefer fast compressed RAM over disk cache"
msgstr "при активном Zram — предпочесть быструю сжатую оперативную память дисковому кэшу"

msgid "Swappiness not optimized for Zram"
msgstr "Swappiness не оптимизирована для Zram"

msgid "Zram is active but swappiness is {0} instead of {1}. Set it to {1} to prefer fast compressed RAM swap — dropping file cache when zram is available wastes I/O performance."
msgstr "Zram активен, но swappiness установлена в значение {0}, а не {1}. Установите значение {1}, чтобы предпочесть быструю сжатую виртуальную память в оперативной памяти — отбрасывание файлового кэша при наличии zram приводит к потере производительности ввода-вывода."

msgid "with Zram"
msgstr "с Zram"

msgid "How aggressively the kernel swaps — with Zram active, set to {0} to prefer fast compressed RAM over disk cache (recommended: {0})"
msgstr "Насколько агрессивно ядро использует подкачку — при активном Zram установите значение {0}, чтобы предпочесть быструю сжатую оперативную память дисковому кэшу (рекомендуется: {0})"
